      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nExceptional Detached Family Home on a Generous Site \n\nNestled in a peaceful countryside setting on the edge of Portlaoise Town, this impressive detached residence offers the perfect balance of rural tranquillity and everyday convenience. Set on a substantial, well-maintained site with extensive gardens, ample parking, and a large detached shed/workshop, this is a property that offers exceptional space both inside and out.\n\nThe bright and spacious accommodation extends over two floors and is presented in excellent condition throughout. A welcoming entrance hall leads to a selection of generously proportioned living areas, including a comfortable sitting room with feature fireplace, a large country-style kitchen complete with traditional range cooker, and additional reception rooms offering flexibility for family living, working from home, or entertaining.\n\nThe property boasts well-appointed bedrooms, spacious bathrooms, and practical utility areas, making it an ideal home for growing families. Outside, the expansive grounds provide privacy, mature hedging, extensive driveway parking, and endless potential for gardening, hobbies, or outdoor living.\n\nA standout feature is the large detached workshop/shed, perfect for business use, storage, machinery, classic cars, or a wide range of commercial and recreational purposes (subject to any necessary permissions).\n\nProperty Features\nDetached family residence on a large private site\nJust 10 minutes from Portlaoise Town\nSpacious and versatile accommodation throughout\nBright living room with feature fireplace\nLarge country-style kitchen with adjoining dining area\nMultiple reception rooms offering flexible living space\nSpacious bedrooms and family bathrooms\nUtility room and excellent storage\nExtensive tarmac driveway with ample parking\nMature gardens surrounding the property\nLarge detached workshop/shed with excellent potential\nPeaceful countryside location with easy access to schools, shops, the M7 motorway and all local amenities\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in an idyllic rural setting while remaining within easy reach of Portlaoise and major transport links. Offering space, privacy, and fantastic potential, this property is sure to appeal to families, those working from home, or anyone seeking country living without compromising on convenience.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate everything this home has to offer."
      },
